      "name": "Story",
      "settings": {
        "primary_title": "It started in a bathroom.",
        "primary_content": "<p>Ben was doing a face mask with his wife and had a simple thought: Why is none of this made for blokes?<br/><br/>Everything felt like it belonged in someone else’s routine.Soft packaging. Complicated steps. A 12-step skincare circus.<br/><br/>But here’s the reality. Men deal with acne. Men age. Men get tired eyes from long days and short nights.<br/><br/>We just don’t talk about it. And there wasn’t a brand speaking directly to us. So we built one.</p>",
        "secondary_title": "",
        "secondary_content": ""
      }
    },
