      "name": "Story",
      "settings": {
        "primary_title": "Why We Started Rood",
        "primary_content": "<p>We’re not influencers who discovered skincare last year. We’re fellas who live the same life as the men we’re building this for.<br/><br/>Early mornings. Big responsibility. Long days.<br/><br/>We care about how we show up. For our families. For our work. For ourselves. But we don’t have time for 10 serums and a beauty routine that feels like homework. Rood was created to solve that.<br/><br/>Sort your mug. Move on with your day. </p>",
        "secondary_title": "",
        "secondary_content": ""
