      "name": "Story",
      "settings": {
        "primary_title": "The Real Problem",
        "primary_content": "<p>There’s still a quiet stigma around men caring about their skin As if looking sharp somehow makes you less masculine.<br/><br/>We think that’s outdated. Modern masculinity is ownership, discipline and confidence.<br/><br/>Looking better isn’t vanity, it’s preparation.<br/><br/>If you train your body. If you sharpen your mind. Why ignore your skin?</p>",
        "secondary_title": "Where This Is Going",
        "secondary_content": "<p>Rood isn’t just products. It’s a ritual. A reset before you step back into the arena. We’re building more than skincare. We’re building culture.<br/><br/>A brand for men who get stuff done. Men who take ownership.  Men who want to look sharp without overthinking it.<br/><br/>This is about looking better. So you can show up better.<br/><br/>- Adam, Ben & Jordy</p>"
      }
